{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auckland Airport</strong>\u00a0(IATA: <strong>AKL</strong>, ICAO: <strong>NZAA</strong>) is a major international airline hub serving New Zealand\u00a0with many domestic and international destinations for visitors to continue on to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is the largest and busiest single-runway airport in Oceania, able to handle about 45 plane movements per hour.\u00a0A second runway is planned to be constructed by 2025.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auckland Airport has two main buildings: the International Terminal and the Domestic Terminal.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 1\u201310 are in Pier A. Gate 10 can handle a large A380 plane.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 15 to 18 are in Pier B. These gates can handle A380 planes with two jetbridges. They can also handle two smaller planes at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 4A, 4B, 4C, 4D, 16A, 16B, 16C, and 16D are bus gates. Passengers use these to get to planes parked further away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stands 19\u201320, 70\u201373, 82\u201384, and 74\u201381 are remote parking spots for planes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880160?t=1752744312","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880160/2ac35120565b7288d3c7c57fb54adb515c0abc32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752744312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880160/2466bd5915d95d2315dd58f64c94fc639c20a7ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752744312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880160/2466bd5915d95d2315dd58f64c94fc639c20a7ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752744312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auckland Airport</strong>\u00a0(IATA: <strong>AKL</strong>, ICAO: <strong>NZAA</strong>) is a major international airline hub serving New Zealand\u00a0with many domestic and international destinations for visitors to continue on to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is the largest and busiest single-runway airport in Oceania, able to handle about 45 plane movements per hour.\u00a0A second runway is planned to be constructed by 2025.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auckland Airport has two main buildings: the International Terminal and the Domestic Terminal.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 1\u201310 are in Pier A. Gate 10 can handle a large A380 plane.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 15 to 18 are in Pier B. These gates can handle A380 planes with two jetbridges. They can also handle two smaller planes at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gates 4A, 4B, 4C, 4D, 16A, 16B, 16C, and 16D are bus gates. Passengers use these to get to planes parked further away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stands 19\u201320, 70\u201373, 82\u201384, and 74\u201381 are remote parking spots for planes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["FeelThere"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2176130","name":"Tower! Simulator 3"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam